      "message": "If I don\u0027t add this information, `git cl upload` will report the following error:\n**********************************************************************\n** Presubmit ERRORS: 2 **\nresources\\sksl\\BUILD.bazel needs to have\nlicenses([\"notice\"])\nimmediately after the load() calls to comply with G3 policies.\n\nresources\\sksl\\BUILD.bazel needs to have\npackage(default_applicable_licenses \u003d [\"//:license\"])\nto comply with G3 policies\n\nPresubmit checks took 5.5s to calculate.\nThere were presubmit errors.\n**********************************************************************",
