      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is just an incompatibility with the presubmit validation script and uploading from windows (it\u0027s assuming `/` for path separators and ignores BUILD.bazel file paths that begin with \"resources/`\" whereas on your machine, the path is being reported with `\\`).\n\nYou can bypass this by just doing `git cl upload --bypass-hooks` and everything should be okay.",
